flowchart TB
  Director[Director / Associate / Researcher] --> Reports[Generate, review, return, approve, archive reports]
  Director --> Impact[View aggregate impact and authorized details]
  Finance[Finance Officer] --> FinanceDashboard[View Finance queues]
  Barangay[Captain / Secretary / Mother Leader] --> BarangayDashboard[View own-barangay summary]
  Volunteer[Volunteer] --> VolunteerDashboard[View own participation summary]
  Admin[System Admin] --> AdminDashboard[View account/security summary]
  Admin --> Readiness[Inspect flags, runtimes, authority, queues]
  Admin --> Delivery[Configure disabled/synthetic/live delivery runtime]
  Delivery --> Requeue[Explicitly requeue eligible suppressed messages]
  Legacy[Historical institutional identity] --> LegacyPortal[Historical summary only]
